{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09478","headline":"石鼓歌 · 韦应物","name":"石鼓歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"周宣大猎兮岐之阳，刻石表功兮炜煌煌。\n石如鼓形数止十，风雨缺讹苔藓涩。\n今人濡纸脱其文，既击既埽白黑分。\n忽开满卷不可识，惊潜动蛰走云云。\n喘逶迤，相纠错，乃是宣王之臣史籀作。\n一书遗此天地间，精意长存世冥寞。\n秦家祖龙还刻石，碣石之罘李斯迹。\n世人好古犹共传，持来比此殊悬隔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09478.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09478","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}